            "review_title": "Review at Zôm pub & Tours",
            "review_text": "GIang N\nBac Ninh, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nIt’s such a wonderful trip with a best people we have met in Viet Nam\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe stopped by Zom pub after a long bus ride from Hanoi because it was right at the bus stop. The drinks were delicious and reasonably priced. The owner was very friendly and helped us arrange our 3-day Loop trip. What's more, we convinced him to be our tour guide. It was a great choice. The trip couldn't have been more wonderful.\nWritten December 9, 2025",
