            "review_title": "Review at Zôm pub & Tours",
            "review_text": "Lukas S\n4 contributions\n0\nGreat Ha Giang Loop experience!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nWe did a 3 Day 2 Nights Ha Giang Loop trip in a small group with Giang as a tour guide and we really enjoyed our time with him on and off the road!\nThe landscapes are amazing, the pacing of the stops well timed in duration and timing (to avoid larger crowds) and overall, the atmosphere of the trip was very relaxed, we always had the time we needed. \nGiang is friendly, open minded, very informative. He is fluent in English, communication was never a problem as we experienced in some places in vietnam. His motorbike skills are excellent, safety was never a concern for us. \n\nWe can only recommend doing a tour with him to anyone considering.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 5, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
