            "review_title": "Review at Zôm pub & Tours",
            "review_text": "Phi Thanh T\n21 contributions\n0\n3 Day Ha Giang Loop - no Hype, Best VN nature\nDec 2025 • Couples\nI rarely write reviews, but Joe absolutely deserves it! We did a 3-day tour with a total of four people – perfectly planned, beautiful places, no crowded spots.\n\nJoe is extremely helpful: When my wife got sick on the way, he immediately organized tea, soup and everything necessary. The next day she was well again.\n\nThe tour was familiar, fun and warm from the start – truly unforgettable.\n\nSafety was also a top priority at all times. Joe drives responsibly: not too fast, not too slow, just right.\n\nConclusion: One of the best tours we've ever done. Absolutely recommend!\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten December 3, 2025",
